result:
Ya tengo lo necesario para proponer el arreglo: los tres objetos con `origin` fallan el cast a `Message` porque les falta `uuid` (campo requerido de `MessageBase`), y el propio mensaje de `tsc` lo nombra como la causa. Sigo el patrón ya usado en `messageQueries.test.ts` (`uuid: '<valor>' as UUID`).

```json
{"file": "src/packages/agent/__tests__/extractConversationText.test.ts",
 "edits": [
   {"old": "import { describe, expect, test } from 'bun:test'
import { extractConversationText } from '../sessionTitle.js'
import type { Message } from '../messageShapes.js'",
    "new": "import { describe, expect, test } from 'bun:test'
import type { UUID } from 'node:crypto'
import { extractConversationText } from '../sessionTitle.js'
import type { Message } from '../messageShapes.js'"},
   {"old": "    const human = {
      type: 'user',
      origin: { kind: 'human' },
      message: { content: 'real' },
    } as Message",
    "new": "    const human = {
      type: 'user',
      uuid: '11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111' as UUID,
      origin: { kind: 'human' },
      message: { content: 'real' },
    } as Message"},
   {"old": "    const agent = {
      type: 'user',
      origin: { kind: 'agent' },
      message: { content: 'agent output' },
    } as Message",
    "new": "    const agent = {
      type: 'user',
      uuid: '22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222' as UUID,
      origin: { kind: 'agent' },
      message: { content: 'agent output' },
    } as Message"},
   {"old": "    const channel = {
      type: 'user',
      origin: { kind: 'channel' },
      message: { content: 'channel notification' },
    } as Message",
    "new": "    const channel = {
      type: 'user',
      uuid: '33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333' as UUID,
      origin: { kind: 'channel' },
      message: { content: 'channel notification' },
    } as Message"}
 ],
 "patterns": [
   {"patron": "missing-required-uuid-in-message-literal-cast",
    "senal_del_verificador": "TS2352:[\s\S]*?Property 'uuid' is missing[\s\S]*?required in type 'MessageBase'",
    "fix_generico": "Cuando un objeto literal se castea a `Message`/`UserMessage`/etc. y `tsc` reporta TS2352 con "Property 'uuid' is missing ... required in type 'MessageBase'", el objeto le falta el campo `uuid` (requerido en `MessageBase`, `src/packages/agent/messageShapes.ts`). Se agrega `uuid: '<valor-con-forma-de-uuid>' as UUID` (importando `type { UUID } from 'node:crypto'`), siguiendo el precedente ya usado en `messageQueries.test.ts`. No se toca la forma de `MessageBase` ni se usa `as unknown as`/`as any`.",
    "edits": [1, 2, 3]}
 ],
 "fixes": [
